## ✨ Key Features

- **Smart Priority Routing Engine**: Automatically scans citizen issue descriptions for critical keywords (`broken`, `leak`, `water`, `danger`, `crack`, `fire`) and instantly promotes matching tickets to **HIGH PRIORITY**, sorting them directly to the top of the queue.
- **Dynamic Configuration Dashboard**: Fully customizable settings tab where users can add or remove priority keywords, issue categories, and government agency endpoints in real time.
- **Citizen Intake Portal**: Captures reporter details, category selection, target agency routing, and descriptive text.
- **Memory Queue Management**: Dispatches active tickets, slicing them out of active memory arrays to simulate real-world backend API payloads.
- **Adaptive Theming**: Built-in support for Dark Mode, Light Mode, and System Default preferences.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3 (CSS Custom Properties / Variables)
- **Logic:** Vanilla JavaScript (Arrays, Conditionals, DOM Manipulation)
- **Styling:** Modern Slate & Cyberpunk UI with Responsive Flexbox Layouts

